er_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","user":"espritdecalmar","date":". 11-07-2018, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T12:02:05-08:00","id":1265343,"title":"","content":"The Persistent effect of the Cannibalize Alembic (<b>Pg. 44</b>) mentions an &quot;extra die&quot; of damage. Does this mean a +1L Weapon Bonus or something else? The Cannibalize Alembic also isn't priced anything remotely like any other Alembic or even the Transhuman Potential ability.<br /> Invigorate, first Distillation of the Unleash Alembic (<b>Pg. 45</b>) doesn't do anything for Prometheans or Pandorans, which already don't suffer Wound Penalties.<br /> Azothic Mantle (<b>Pg. 45</b>), third Distillation of the Unleash Alembic should last for the scene unless otherwise mentioned, as per all other Distillations, but the last line of the effects of a success imply that it only lasts for a single turn.<br /> <br /> The Hitchhiker (<b>Pg. 57</b>) doesn't specify which Attributes the Dread Power Briareus' Prowess boosts.<br /> Same problem with Hive (<b>Pg. 59</b>), which also doesn't specify what the Beastly Mutation Dread Power does.<br /> Nuharul's Defense (<b>Pg. 63</b>) should be 15 if their Beastly Mutation Dread Power boosts Defense in addition to applying it to Firearms attacks.<br /> The Stack's Swarm Form Dread Power (<b>Pg. 68</b>) doesn't have a scaling dot rating like other Pandoran Dread Powers. Should it allow the Pandoran to transform into a Swarm of a Size equal to (Rank x dot rating)?<br /> Astrid's Beastly Mutation of Extending Arms (<b>Pg. 74</b>) doesn't specify what its extra ability does.<br /> <br /> The Rake (Lesser Elpidos; <b>Pg. 109</b>) mentions the Numina Burning Coal, which isn't present in 2E.<br /> Rose (Lesser Lilithim; <b>Pg. 110</b>) mentions the Numina Pray for Rain, which isn't present in 2E.<br /> None of the Greater Qashmallim (<b>Pg. 111-115</b>) have Attributes or Numina.<br /> Ash, the Arch-Qashmal (<b>Pg. 117</b>), doesn't have any suggested abilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T17:25:15-08:00","id":1265404,"title":"","content":"My fault:<br /> <br /> <b>p. 75: </b>&quot;<b>xScience</b> (Alchemy) 4&quot; -- cut the x<br /> <b>p. 75: </b>The 1-5 rating for the Implant Dread Power is an artifact of an old draft I forgot to cut; it shouldn't have dots. Cut &quot;+ Implant&quot; from the Dice pool, and change Coeus's Dread Power stats so it doesn't have the (3) after Implant<br /> <b>p. 75: </b>The minus sign before Stamina is missing from the Dice Pool for Implant.<br /> <b>p. 75: </b>&quot;or was <b>correct it </b>about its destiny&quot; -- should be <i>it correct</i><br /> <b>p. 76: </b>&quot;<b>Daisy\u2019s condition \u2014 such is the nature of Flux.&quot;</b> -- The sentence here got cut off. It should read: &quot;Daisy\u2019s condition <u>probably isn\u2019t as neat and tidy as that, and it may be that it changes as time goes on </u>\u2014 such is the nature of Flux.&quot; If all that doesn't fit the page, the whole sentence fragment could just be cut and nothing would be lost.<br /> <b>p. 79: </b>&quot;Its form is threefold, existing as a twisting, metal thing Prometheans recognize as a<b> sublimatus</b><b>:</b> a facsimile of a home <b>computer and </b>the nanite spores it uses to infect its victims.&quot; -- the colon should be a comma, and there should be a comma after <i>computer </i>to make the list more obvious<br /> <b>p. 83: </b>&quot;Spark considers them a nuisance, <b>even </b>worth murdering&quot; -- there should be a <i>not </i>before the word even","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 11-25-2018, 10:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-07T20:58:46-08:00","id":1265442,"title":"","content":"Julie Cheng has a dice pool of 6 for Role-related actions, but the rules seem to imply all Petrificati have a dice pool of 4. Please correct or put in advancement rules.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T00:18:57-08:00","id":1265458,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 79: </b>Mortimer's Speed should be 21, and Initiative should be 8","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T09:42:09-08:00","id":1265522,"title":"","content":"p 139 and 140 make reference to the Zeky's Intensity rating but never says what their rating is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-08T18:35:10-08:00","id":1265638,"title":"","content":"None of the characters in the Tormented 'chapter' have their Bestowment listed, except for the Hollow.<br /> Only one of the Zeka have a Bestowment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 11-10-2018, 12:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T00:52:54-08:00","id":1265715,"title":"","content":"p 138 makes reference to Burning Tilt, but doesn't explain coverage.<br /> p 138 also lists Contaminated as a condition but is clearly a tilt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T03:09:21-08:00","id":1265745,"title":"","content":"Several of the Alchemists lack their Persistent Conditions; (which affects both how they are roleplayed and their mechanical interactions).<br /> <br /> All three Greater Qashmallim lack mechanical statistics. (Pages 112, 113 &amp; 115)<br /> <br /> Both the <b>Burning Coal </b>(pg 109) and <b>Pray for Rain </b>(pg 110) Numen are not described.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":1624,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","user":"FallenEco","date":". 11-28-2018, 07:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T07:21:12-08:00","id":1265814,"title":"","content":"On page 145: &quot;then responds in kind with an entirely new [. . .] subcategory entirely.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-09T21:18:02-08:00","id":1266091,"title":"","content":"<b>p. 136: </b>There's an extra wide line break in the middle of the Einstein quote.<br /> <b>p. 136: </b>&quot;...landscapes infused <b>with harsh glow</b> of Cherenkov radiation...&quot; -- missing a the<br /> <b>p. 137: </b>The Radiation Intensity table in the left hand column is in 